---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArrowIcon from '../../components/ArrowIcon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Where We Work — TH Homes" description="TH Homes is based in Abuja and considers selected projects in other locations.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-image about-hero abuja-hero">
    <img class="about-hero-main" src="/Images/home-front-design-2.jpeg" alt="Contemporary residential design with layered balconies" width="4000" height="3200" />
    <div class="page-hero-inner"><h1>Abuja is our base, not our boundary.</h1><p>It is our home and priority market. We also consider projects elsewhere when the brief, partnership and delivery conditions align.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-inner intro-grid" data-reveal><p class="intro-copy">Every location deserves informed attention.</p><div class="intro-aside"><p>Being close to a project creates a clearer line between the brief, the drawing, the site and the finished space. Abuja gives us that foundation; carefully selected work beyond the city begins with the same commitment to context and accountable delivery.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects">Explore selected work <ArrowIcon /></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section abuja-principles"><div class="section-inner"><div class="section-head" data-reveal><h2>Grounded wherever we work.</h2><p>Every project begins with its own place, people and brief. These principles keep the work specific rather than generic.</p></div><div class="abuja-principles-grid" data-reveal><article><h3>Context</h3><p>Orientation, climate, access and material choices are considered as part of the architecture—not added after it.</p></article><article><h3>Everyday living</h3><p>Plans respond to privacy, gathering, service spaces and the rhythms of the people who will use them.</p></article><article><h3>Delivery</h3><p>Design intent stays connected to site decisions, quality control and the realities of construction.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="abuja-frame" data-reveal><img src="/Images/interior-sitting-room.jpg" alt="Warmly detailed contemporary living room interior" width="880" height="1100" loading="lazy" /><div><h2>From the building to the room.</h2><p>Architecture and interiors are developed as one experience, giving proportion, materials, light and furniture a shared direction.</p><a class="text-link light" href="/projects#interiors">View interior work <ArrowIcon /></a></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band cta-pattern" data-reveal><h2>Have a project in mind?</h2><a class="button" href="/consultation">Start a conversation</a></section>
</BaseLayout>
